{"src":"en","tgt":"bn","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"bn","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7706.4837959999995,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":8805.896995,"text":"আপনি যদি National Treasure সিনেমাটি দেখে থাকেন, তবে আপনার মনে হতে পারে যে Declaration of Independence-এর পেছনে একটি গুপ্তধনের মানচিত্র লেখা ছিল।"},{"kind":"audio","t":8982.287734000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":630,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8986.830536000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":8991.971428,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":8997.374665,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":9002.922729999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9008.224139999998,"samples":31486,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1010},{"kind":"input","t":13874.544700999999,"text":"The hot chocolate is up to Belgian standards. Fruit juices are pricey, but after a while, you'll be able to taste the sweetness."},{"kind":"text","t":14593.807921,"text":"হট চকলেটটি বেলজিয়ান মানের। ফলের রস দামি, তবে কিছু সময় পর আপনি এর মিষ্টি স্বাদ অনুভব করতে পারবেন।"},{"kind":"audio","t":14738.750559,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14743.612575,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14749.055842000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14754.181294000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14759.679649999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":14761.938382,"samples":14767,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":22219.762946,"text":"However, that is not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"text","t":22980.842990999998,"text":"তবে, তা সত্যি নয়। যদিও নথির পেছনে কিছু লেখা আছে, তবে এটি কোনো গুপ্তধনের মানচিত্র নয়।"},{"kind":"audio","t":23103.397852,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23108.968645999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":550,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23114.55775,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23119.925578,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23122.865168,"samples":20229,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":29990.199915999998,"text":"You may also wish to consult the advice of governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their citizens."},{"kind":"text","t":30945.382586,"text":"আপনি আপনার নিজস্ব সরকারের বাইরে অন্যান্য সরকারের পরামর্শও নিতে পারেন, তবে তাদের পরামর্শ তাদের নিজস্ব নাগরিকদের কথা মাথায় রেখে তৈরি করা হয়েছে।"},{"kind":"audio","t":31096.864881999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31099.89974,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31103.286971999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":31106.577005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31109.874589,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31113.166731999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":31113.542416,"samples":5684,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":41297.406050000005,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives the territory of Hong Kong its name and is a place that many tourists regard as the main focus."},{"kind":"text","t":42363.757456,"text":"হংকং দ্বীপ হংকং ভূখণ্ডটিকে তার নাম দিয়েছে এবং এটি এমন একটি জায়গা যাকে অনেক পর্যটক প্রধান আকর্ষণ হিসেবে গণ্য করেন।"},{"kind":"audio","t":42506.176156,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42511.19294,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":42516.439280000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42522.173902,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":42525.710072,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42528.798789,"samples":29257,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":930},{"kind":"input","t":49419.207472,"text":"Anyone who's going to drive at hot latitudes or over mountain passes should consider the possibility of snow, ice, or free"},{"kind":"text","t":50625.601899,"text":"যারা উষ্ণ অক্ষাংশে বা পার্বত্য গিরিপথে গাড়ি চালাবেন, তাদের তুষার, বরফ বা হিমবাহের সম্ভাবনার কথা বিবেচনা করা উচিত।"},{"kind":"audio","t":50764.778015,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":50769.734261000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":50774.807554,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50780.139002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50785.497050000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50788.604567,"samples":20619,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":58793.485241,"text":"Segregation and recombination shuffle variation back and forth between the two pools."},{"kind":"text","t":59821.925857,"text":"পৃথকীকরণ এবং পুনর্মিলন দুটি পুলের মধ্যে বৈচিত্র্যকে এদিক-সেদিক অদলবদল করে।"},{"kind":"audio","t":59940.021444000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59945.041848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59950.76077,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":59956.251176000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59959.623268,"samples":20229,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":61183.365138,"text":"with each generation."},{"kind":"text","t":61433.918587,"text":"প্রতিটি প্রজন্মের সাথে।"},{"kind":"audio","t":61473.485869000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":61473.893432000004,"samples":4290,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":66512.703089,"text":"The term bug is used by entomologists in a formal sense for this group of insects."},{"kind":"text","t":67392.317193,"text":"কীটতত্ত্ববিদরা পতঙ্গের এই গোষ্ঠীর জন্য আনুষ্ঠানিকভাবে 'বাগ' (bug) শব্দটি ব্যবহার করেন।"},{"kind":"audio","t":67503.046987,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67507.917263,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":67513.15386399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67518.559331,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67519.739571,"samples":10476,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":160},{"kind":"input","t":74698.707501,"text":"First, most riders wearing riding boots with a heel and a smooth, quite narrow sole."},{"kind":"text","t":75724.77522699999,"text":"প্রথমত, অধিকাংশ আরোহী হিলযুক্ত এবং মসৃণ, বেশ সরু সোলের রাইডিং বুট পরতেন।"},{"kind":"audio","t":75853.563001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75858.830451,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75864.253608,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75869.72342499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75873.599238,"samples":24687,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"input","t":83918.101144,"text":"The commission was Martelli's response to widespread anti-regime protests that started in October."},{"kind":"text","t":84703.304446,"text":"অক্টোবরে শুরু হওয়া ব্যাপক সরকার-বিরোধী বিক্ষোভের প্রতিক্রিয়া হিসেবে মার্টেলি এই কমিশন গঠন করেছিলেন।"},{"kind":"audio","t":84824.643767,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84825.88928599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":84827.358891,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":84828.95273399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84830.273141,"samples":28588,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"input","t":91141.26733799999,"text":"Fire rescue crews eventually doused the fire by 11.35pm."},{"kind":"text","t":91813.285158,"text":"দমকল কর্মীরা শেষ পর্যন্ত রাত ১১.৩৫ মিনিটের মধ্যে আগুন নিয়ন্ত্রণে আনেন।"},{"kind":"audio","t":91914.787549,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91916.120807,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91917.586342,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":91919.076546,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":91919.331062,"samples":2117,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":97371.695735,"text":"The tensioning storm of the Atlantic hurricane season, Subtropic Storm Jerry,"},{"kind":"text","t":98284.35849299999,"text":"আটলান্টিক হারিকেন সিজনের উত্তেজনাকর ঝড়, সাবট্রপিক স্টর্ম জেরি,"},{"kind":"audio","t":98377.16498399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98378.48650099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":98379.886707,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98381.093306,"samples":25969,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":740},{"kind":"input","t":100365.587877,"text":"formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"text","t":100880.061515,"text":"আজ আটলান্টিক মহাসাগরে সৃষ্টি হয়েছে।"},{"kind":"audio","t":100934.179708,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100935.535895,"samples":32433,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"input","t":107295.07734999999,"text":"It has brought us to train the car and many other transportation devices."},{"kind":"text","t":107966.77133599999,"text":"এটি আমাদের গাড়ি এবং আরও অনেক পরিবহন যন্ত্র প্রশিক্ষিত করতে সাহায্য করেছে।"},{"kind":"audio","t":108067.069878,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":108072.360867,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":108078.04471,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108081.728537,"samples":25411,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":116622.38189599999,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":117474.343434,"text":"এটি বিলাসিতার কেন্দ্রবিন্দু হিসেবে পরিচিত, যা প্রায় ৪০০ খ্রিস্টাব্দে শুরু হয়েছিল এবং চলেছিল..."},{"kind":"audio","t":117586.01289099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117591.41730799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":117597.094101,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117602.62077699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117604.304528,"samples":12427,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":230},{"kind":"input","t":120745.29843,"text":"until about 1100 A.D."},{"kind":"text","t":121066.45197899999,"text":"প্রায় ১১০০ খ্রিস্টাব্দ পর্যন্ত।"},{"kind":"audio","t":121120.53167299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121121.78601099999,"samples":31040,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":980},{"kind":"input","t":127069.33965299999,"text":"The surface of the moon is made of rocks and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"text","t":127610.645532,"text":"চাঁদের উপরিভাগ পাথর এবং ধুলো দিয়ে তৈরি। চাঁদের বাইরের স্তরটিকে ভূত্বক বলা হয়।"},{"kind":"audio","t":127746.451076,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":127747.643816,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":127748.868725,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127750.557666,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127751.293723,"samples":19950,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":134213.49127,"text":"The U.S. Corps of Engineers estimated that six inches of rainfall could breach the previously damaged"},{"kind":"text","t":135094.04932800002,"text":"ইউ.এস. কোর অফ ইঞ্জিনিয়ার্স অনুমান করেছে যে ছয় ইঞ্চি বৃষ্টিপাত আগে থেকে ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত অংশটি ভেঙে ফেলতে পারে"},{"kind":"audio","t":135152.405919,"samples":27306,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":830},{"kind":"audio","t":135228.923458,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135233.67369700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135238.985846,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135244.25018600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":135244.911484,"samples":6854,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":141188.983406,"text":"In particular, it is claimed that one can detect whether a person is lying by interpreting micro-expressions correctly."},{"kind":"text","t":142285.65081300001,"text":"বিশেষ করে, দাবি করা হয় যে মাইক্রো-এক্সপ্রেশনগুলো সঠিকভাবে ব্যাখ্যা করার মাধ্যমে একজন ব্যক্তি মিথ্যা বলছেন কি না তা শনাক্ত করা সম্ভব।"},{"kind":"audio","t":142439.75042300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142445.00370300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142450.500189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":142455.78609900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":142461.326624,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142466.64168300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142467.090735,"samples":9027,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":147237.028727,"text":"Do not deface the site by marking or scratching graffiti into structure."},{"kind":"text","t":147949.01115200002,"text":"কাঠামোতে গ্রাফিতি লিখে বা আঁচড় কেটে সাইটটি নষ্ট করবেন না।"},{"kind":"audio","t":148031.221064,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148036.19273900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148041.220303,"samples":30873,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"input","t":154876.745016,"text":"The tiger's roar is not like the full-voiced roar of a lion, but more like a sentence of snarly, shouted words."},{"kind":"text","t":156077.86649400002,"text":"বাঘের গর্জন সিংহের পূর্ণকণ্ঠের গর্জনের মতো নয়, বরং তা অনেকটা কর্কশ, চিৎকার করা শব্দের একটি বাক্যের মতো।"},{"kind":"audio","t":156226.05035600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156231.153388,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156236.583275,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":156242.14874,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156247.51390800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156249.14213000002,"samples":12260,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":170},{"kind":"input","t":161914.43320600002,"text":"20th century research has shown that there are two pools of genetic variation, hidden and expressed."},{"kind":"text","t":162767.581584,"text":"বিংশ শতাব্দীর গবেষণায় দেখা গেছে যে জেনেটিক বৈচিত্র্যের দুটি পুল রয়েছে, লুকানো এবং প্রকাশিত।"},{"kind":"audio","t":162894.953692,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162899.93922700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":162905.065119,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162910.36696900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162915.847195,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":162916.183809,"samples":5015,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":173105.27247300002,"code":1005}]}